direction: right

Internet: Internet {
  shape: cloud
}

GitHub: GitHub (GitOps Source) {
  icon: github
}

GCP: Google Cloud Platform {
  icon: gcp
  
  Terraform: Terraform State (GCS) {
    icon: terraform
  }
  
  Cloudflare: Cloudflare Edge {
    shape: step
  }
  
  GKE: Google Kubernetes Engine {
    icon: kubernetes
    
    Ingress: Nginx Ingress
    cloudflared: Cloudflared Tunnel
    
    ArgoCD: ArgoCD {
      icon: argocd
    }
    
    App: Application Layer {
      API: Node.js API
      Dashboard: Web Dashboard (Nginx)
      ETL: Python ETL
    }
    
    Data: Data Layer {
      MQTT: Mosquitto Broker
      PostgreSQL: PostgreSQL
      InfluxDB: InfluxDB
    }
    
    Observability: Observability Stack {
      Prometheus: Prometheus
      Grafana: Grafana
      Loki: Loki
      Alloy: Grafana Alloy
    }
  }
}

Internet -> GCP.Cloudflare: HTTPS
GCP.Cloudflare -> GCP.GKE.cloudflared: Secure Tunnel
GCP.GKE.cloudflared -> GCP.GKE.Ingress: Proxy

GCP.GKE.Ingress -> GCP.GKE.App.Dashboard: /
GCP.GKE.Ingress -> GCP.GKE.App.API: /api
GCP.GKE.Ingress -> GCP.GKE.Data.MQTT: /mqtt (WebSocket)
GCP.GKE.Ingress -> GCP.GKE.Observability.Grafana: ops.*/grafana

GCP.GKE.App.Dashboard -> GCP.GKE.App.API: REST (auth proxy)
GCP.GKE.App.API -> GCP.GKE.Data.PostgreSQL: Queries / Sessions
GCP.GKE.App.API -> GCP.GKE.Data.InfluxDB: Read Telemetry

Internet -> GCP.GKE.Data.MQTT: IoT Sensor Publish
GCP.GKE.Data.MQTT -> GCP.GKE.Data.InfluxDB: Telegraf Bridge
GCP.GKE.Data.MQTT -> GCP.GKE.App.ETL: Subscribe
GCP.GKE.App.ETL -> GCP.GKE.Data.PostgreSQL: Upsert Alerts
GCP.GKE.App.ETL -> GCP.GKE.Data.InfluxDB: Poll History

GCP.GKE.Observability.Alloy -> GCP.GKE.Observability.Loki: Ship Logs
GCP.GKE.Observability.Prometheus -> GCP.GKE.App.API: Scrape Metrics
GCP.GKE.Observability.Prometheus -> GCP.GKE.Data.PostgreSQL: Scrape Exporter
GCP.GKE.Observability.Grafana -> GCP.GKE.Observability.Prometheus: Query
GCP.GKE.Observability.Grafana -> GCP.GKE.Observability.Loki: Query

GitHub -> GCP.GKE.ArgoCD: GitOps Pull
GCP.GKE.ArgoCD -> GCP.GKE: Reconcile State
GitHub -> GCP.Terraform: CI/CD Apply (Actions)
GCP.Terraform -> GCP.GKE: Manage Infrastructure
